OL,3,GNEWSACare home manager stole #50k from
OL,4,Aresidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former care home manager who offered
OL,7,Fto help families who were struggling to
OL,8,Fpay residents' fees but then paid the
OL,9,Fmoney into her own bank account has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed.
OL,12,FMichaela Golding, 58, pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Ffraud by abuse of position and to false
OL,14,Faccounting.
OL,16,FShe stole more than #50,000 from
OL,17,Fvulnerable residents and their families
OL,18,Fat a care home in Filey between October
OL,19,F2022 and June 2024, York Crown Court
OL,20,Fheard earlier.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
